</p></div><div class="hri-content-card__footer"><button type="button" data-skapa="button@19.0.24" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" class="hri-btn hri-btn--small hri-btn--icon-secondary hri-content-card__cta"><span class="hri-typography-label-s hri-btn__inner"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" width="24" height="24" data-skapa="ssr-icon@11.10.0" aria-hidden="true" class="hri-svg-icon hri-btn__icon"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m20.0008 12.0001-8-8.001-1.4143 1.414L16.1727 11H4v2h12.1723l-5.5868 5.5866 1.4141 1.4142 8.0012-8.0007z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="hri-card__media"><span data-skapa="aspect-ratio-box@15.1.29" class="hri-aspect-ratio-box hri-aspect-ratio-box--square"><img alt src="https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg" srcset="https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=xxxs 240w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=xxs 300w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=xs 400w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=s 500w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=m 600w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=l 750w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=xl 800w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=xxl 950w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=xxxl 1400w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/43f6d5d60a28473/original/PH210821.jpg?f=sg 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 37.5em) 80vw, max(30vw, 25.625rem)" loading="eager" data-skapa="image@7.0.19" class="hri-image"/></span></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="hri-carousel-slide _carouselItem_d3833_1"><div data-testid="hri-trending-articles-link-6" class="_cardWrapper_d3833_17"><div class="hri-card hri-card--trailing-media hri-trending-articles-card"><div data-skapa="card@19.1.15" data-testid="hri-trending-articles-card-content-6" style="--content-card-background:rgb(var(--colour-elevation-2, 255, 255, 255));" class="hri-content-card hri-content-card--fixed hri-content-card--dark-foreground hri-typography-typescale-small-screen hri-trending-articles-carousel__link"><div class="hri-content-card__container"><a href="https://www.ikea.com/se/sv/ideas/tips-for-more-sustainable-living/minska-avfall-hemma-pub73552660/" class="hri-content-card__headers"><h3 class="hri-typography-heading-xl hri-content-card__title">Snabba tips för att minska avfallet hemma</h3></a><p class="hri-text hri-typography-body-m hri-text--lighter hri-content-card__body">Kolla in de här enkla tipsen för att minska hushållsavfallet och samtidigt göra ditt hem lite snyggare. Hitta tips för att återanvända rester, återvinningstips och mycket mer.</p></div><div class="hri-content-card__footer"><button type="button" data-skapa="button@19.0.24" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" class="hri-btn hri-btn--small hri-btn--icon-secondary hri-content-card__cta"><span class="hri-typography-label-s hri-btn__inner"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" width="24" height="24" data-skapa="ssr-icon@11.10.0" aria-hidden="true" class="hri-svg-icon hri-btn__icon"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m20.0008 12.0001-8-8.001-1.4143 1.414L16.1727 11H4v2h12.1723l-5.5868 5.5866 1.4141 1.4142 8.0012-8.0007z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="hri-card__media"><span data-skapa="aspect-ratio-box@15.1.29" class="hri-aspect-ratio-box hri-aspect-ratio-box--square"><img alt src="https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/1312fd8d297a186a/original/GC-CF-PeopleandPlanetCommunication-Web-Image-1x1-IKEA365.png" srcset="https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/1312fd8d297a186a/original/GC-CF-PeopleandPlanetCommunication-Web-Image-1x1-IKEA365.png?f=xxxs 240w, https://www.ikea.com/ext/ingkadam/m/1312fd8d297a